WEBVTT

1
00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:38.095
Whoever said that
"man writes his own destiny... "

2
00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:40.764
He was bullshitting

3
00:01:12.272 --> 00:01:13.330
Are we landing?

4
00:01:19.212 --> 00:01:20.270
Sorry.

5
00:03:46.693 --> 00:03:47.751
Name?

6
00:03:48.695 --> 00:03:49.753
I've already told you

7
00:03:49.829 --> 00:03:53.094
Repeat it... Aamir Ali.

8
00:03:54.033 --> 00:03:55.694
What do you do?
- I'm a doctor.

9
00:03:56.169 --> 00:03:57.227
Local address?

10
00:03:57.971 --> 00:04:00.838
A-4, 411, Lakhani Complex,
Malad West, Mumbai-400...

11
00:04:00.907 --> 00:04:01.965
What is the purpose of your visit?

12
00:04:03.176 --> 00:04:04.234
It's my home.

13
00:04:05.778 --> 00:04:08.372
Is this just a homecoming or
is something else the reason?

14
00:04:09.649 --> 00:04:10.707
I don't get you.

15
00:04:11.985 --> 00:04:13.111
Your British visa is not renewed...

16
00:04:14.654 --> 00:04:15.712
Why would they?

17
00:04:16.656 --> 00:04:18.647
It's the doctors and
engineers who are making...

18
00:04:18.725 --> 00:04:19.783
...our country proud these days.

19
00:04:19.859 --> 00:04:20.917
All clear.

20
00:04:27.667 --> 00:04:28.725
Check again.

21
00:04:32.005 --> 00:04:33.870
Excuse me, what exactly is the problem?

22
00:04:37.076 --> 00:04:39.271
Sir, my family is waiting for me outside.

23
00:04:39.345 --> 00:04:41.006
Everyone has someone waiting outside.

24
00:04:43.082 --> 00:04:44.743
You've checked my luggage thrice already...

25
00:04:44.817 --> 00:04:46.079
You took my details four times.

26
00:04:46.953 --> 00:04:48.750
You've seen all my papers. Please Sir.

27
00:04:51.891 --> 00:04:53.756
I'm neither a terrorist nor a smuggler.

28
00:04:53.826 --> 00:04:56.226
Nobody walks in here
announcing he is a terrorist...

29
00:04:56.296 --> 00:04:57.354
...it's ourjob to pull them out...

30
00:04:58.298 --> 00:05:02.029
I understand sir, but I'm just
a normal human being - Doctor.

31
00:05:02.101 --> 00:05:03.625
Everyone is a normal human being...

32
00:05:03.703 --> 00:05:04.761
...till they do something
abnormal or inhuman...

33
00:05:05.171 --> 00:05:09.631
No offence to you sir...
but please let us do ourjob...

34
00:05:11.778 --> 00:05:14.042
If my name wasn't Aamir but
Amar would I still be under suspicion?

35
00:05:16.716 --> 00:05:17.774
Sir, it's all clear.

36
00:05:26.059 --> 00:05:27.720
Would you like to recheck
- Next!

37
00:05:32.665 --> 00:05:33.723
Amar.

38
00:07:45.665 --> 00:07:46.723
Hello!

39
00:07:59.278 --> 00:08:00.267
Take the call...

40
00:08:08.888 --> 00:08:09.946
<i>Hello?</i>

41
00:08:10.022 --> 00:08:12.149
<i>Salaam-a le kum -vaalekum-as-salam</i>

42
00:08:12.225 --> 00:08:13.283
<i>Who's this?</i>

43
00:08:13.359 --> 00:08:14.621
<i>Long flight-huh?</i>

44
00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:16.694
<i>I've sent a cab for you</i>
<i>- who is this?</i>

45
00:08:19.031 --> 00:08:20.828
<i>The number is 6688.</i>

46
00:08:21.167 --> 00:08:22.225
<i>Take it. </i>

47
00:08:22.301 --> 00:08:25.361
<i>I think you've got the wrong person. </i>
<i>- I never talk to the wrong person. </i>

48
00:08:30.176 --> 00:08:32.644
<i>I'm telling you... - Your luggage is in</i>
<i>the boot of the cab... </i>

49
00:08:34.247 --> 00:08:36.841
<i>The driver is slightly psychotic</i>
<i>and impatient... </i>

50
00:08:41.654 --> 00:08:42.712
<i>What is this?</i>

51
00:08:43.189 --> 00:08:46.249
<i>Hello! Hello?</i>

52
00:08:50.196 --> 00:08:52.061
Taxi!

53
00:08:53.666 --> 00:08:54.724
My luggage is in that cab!

54
00:09:12.618 --> 00:09:13.676
Stop!

55
00:09:32.104 --> 00:09:35.767
Who the hell are you? How can you
put my luggage in your car?

56
00:09:37.176 --> 00:09:39.167
Absolute bloody nonsense...
what do you want?

57
00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:46.379
I'm just following orders.
I suggest you do the same. - Why?

58
00:10:07.940 --> 00:10:09.202
<i>Told you he is a psycho. </i>

59
00:10:10.209 --> 00:10:11.938
<i>Look whoever you are... </i>

60
00:10:12.011 --> 00:10:16.209
<i>Brother, in our faith</i>
<i>we show respect to our elders. </i>

61
00:10:18.684 --> 00:10:19.742
<i>Look sir... </i>

62
00:10:20.820 --> 00:10:21.878
<i>I'm sorry... </i>

63
00:10:22.221 --> 00:10:25.088
<i>... whoever you are,</i>
<i>you've got the wrong guy. </i>

64
00:10:26.292 --> 00:10:28.760
<i>We don't even know each other. </i>

65
00:10:31.697 --> 00:10:36.760
<i>Aamir Ali. Father's name Rashid Ali. </i>
<i>Mother, Tarannum Ali. </i>

66
00:10:37.837 --> 00:10:39.429
<i>Your father died three years ago. </i>

67
00:10:40.239 --> 00:10:41.297
<i>Your three sisters... </i>

68
00:10:42.041 --> 00:10:46.444
<i>Nargis, Shabana and Falak</i>
<i>and a younger brother Jameel. </i>

69
00:10:47.847 --> 00:10:49.781
<i>You've been practicing medicine in London,</i>
<i>last three years... </i>

70
00:10:50.316 --> 00:10:51.715
<i>After the new bill was passed,</i>
<i>against the immigrant professionals... </i>

71
00:10:51.784 --> 00:10:53.445
<i>... you decided to return... </i>

72
00:10:55.988 --> 00:10:58.115
<i>You were the captain of your school cricket</i>
<i>team. </i>

73
00:10:59.859 --> 00:11:02.987
<i>Want to know more?</i>
<i>About your aunt in Kanpur?</i>

74
00:11:05.865 --> 00:11:09.801
<i>Who are you?</i>
<i>- I'm not important... you are</i>

75
00:11:09.869 --> 00:11:10.927
<i>What do you want from me?</i>

76
00:11:11.003 --> 00:11:12.061
<i>Just stay in the cab!</i>

77
00:11:14.273 --> 00:11:16.867
<i>Hello! Hello?</i>

78
00:11:29.689 --> 00:11:31.213
It's no use. The call won't go through...

79
00:11:36.228 --> 00:11:38.753
Outgoing is barred...
You can't make a call...

80
00:11:45.771 --> 00:11:49.229
Pull over... I want to get out...

81
00:11:51.711 --> 00:11:52.837
I said stop the cab...

82
00:14:03.776 --> 00:14:05.710
<i>Didn't I tell you to stay in the cab?</i>

83
00:14:06.178 --> 00:14:07.236
<i>What do you want?</i>

84
00:14:10.649 --> 00:14:11.911
<i>That psycho has my luggage... </i>

85
00:14:12.985 --> 00:14:14.043
<i>All my papers were in it... </i>

86
00:14:14.119 --> 00:14:17.054
<i>My passport... my asthma medicines. </i>

87
00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:19.724
<i>Sir, please. It's enough!</i>

88
00:14:21.060 --> 00:14:23.858
<i>I have to go home right now!</i>
<i>- You did call home. </i>

89
00:14:24.196 --> 00:14:26.858
<i>No one answered. </i>
<i>- What do you mean?</i>

90
00:14:27.666 --> 00:14:28.724
<i>No one's home. </i>

91
00:14:28.801 --> 00:14:29.859
<i>Why... </i>

92
00:14:31.737 --> 00:14:33.864
<i>There's a little home video in your phone... </i>

93
00:15:17.049 --> 00:15:18.107
<i>Where's my family?</i>

94
00:15:18.918 --> 00:15:19.976
<i>In my living room... </i>

95
00:15:20.052 --> 00:15:21.246
<i>What are you going to do with them?</i>

96
00:15:25.057 --> 00:15:28.857
<i>It's up to you. You have</i>
<i>five hours to save them. </i>

97
00:15:30.996 --> 00:15:33.863
<i>Do as I say and they won't be harmed. </i>

98
00:15:36.068 --> 00:15:38.263
<i>I need you in Dongri in an hour... sharp... </i>

99
00:15:39.672 --> 00:15:42.732
<i>National Restaurant. </i>
<i>There's just one. Find it. </i>

100
00:15:59.024 --> 00:16:00.013
Taxi!

101
00:16:05.631 --> 00:16:06.689
Dongri! Quick!

102
00:16:07.700 --> 00:16:08.758
Which dongri?

103
00:16:08.834 --> 00:16:09.892
You don't know dongri?

104
00:16:09.969 --> 00:16:11.027
No, I'm new here.

105
00:16:11.637 --> 00:16:12.695
Why didn't you say so?

106
00:16:12.771 --> 00:16:13.829
I just did!

107
00:16:13.906 --> 00:16:14.964
Pull over...

108
00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:16.098
I never pushed it in...

109
00:16:21.914 --> 00:16:22.972
Taxi!

110
00:16:27.786 --> 00:16:28.844
Dongri, step on it!

111
00:16:52.745 --> 00:16:56.943
<i>"Walking along, to the left and right... "</i>

112
00:16:59.084 --> 00:17:03.020
<i>"... look at life's ups and downs,</i>
<i>everything in sight"</i>

113
00:17:06.025 --> 00:17:09.017
<i>"where was I headed</i>
<i>and where have I come"</i>

114
00:17:09.094 --> 00:17:12.757
<i>"Spinning that wheel"</i>

115
00:17:12.831 --> 00:17:15.823
<i>"I don't understand it,</i>
<i>there is no one to explain"</i>

116
00:17:15.901 --> 00:17:24.240
<i>"Spinning that wheel. "</i>

117
00:17:52.671 --> 00:17:53.729
<i>Step on it! Hurry up!</i>

118
00:17:58.143 --> 00:18:01.601
<i>"He was running low on luck"</i>

119
00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:04.615
<i>"When he tripped,</i>
<i>his senses came unstuck"</i>

120
00:18:04.683 --> 00:18:08.084
<i>"He forgets his duties and plays"</i>

121
00:18:08.153 --> 00:18:11.884
<i>Uncle, where's National restaurant?</i>
<i>- Don't know. </i>

122
00:18:11.957 --> 00:18:13.618
<i>"He comes to his senses in a daze"</i>

123
00:18:13.692 --> 00:18:14.818
<i>"Life is a vicious circle. "</i>

124
00:18:19.965 --> 00:18:21.830
Where is National restaurant?

125
00:18:22.701 --> 00:18:24.168
National Restaurant?

126
00:18:24.970 --> 00:18:30.704
'It's 1pm and time to listen
to the Hindi news from...

127
00:18:33.912 --> 00:18:35.243
Let me think.

128
00:18:35.314 --> 00:18:37.839
What are you saying?
- The meter is faulty.

129
00:18:37.916 --> 00:18:40.043
Where is National restaurant?
- Under my mojo...

130
00:19:22.761 --> 00:19:25.161
Don't even think about it!
Right... that way...

131
00:19:25.230 --> 00:19:26.288
Mister!

132
00:19:50.722 --> 00:19:52.713
4 cups of tea. Take it.

133
00:19:56.795 --> 00:19:58.057
Go on. It's reserved for you.

134
00:20:37.302 --> 00:20:41.102
I want a cold drink!
- I want fried rice!

135
00:20:46.245 --> 00:20:48.179
<i>Brother, did you get what I asked for?</i>

136
00:20:49.114 --> 00:20:50.103
<i>Yeah... two for you... </i>

137
00:20:50.182 --> 00:20:52.241
<i>And one each for Shabana</i>
<i>and Nargis, don't tell them. </i>

138
00:20:52.718 --> 00:20:53.776
<i>Where are they?</i>

139
00:20:53.852 --> 00:20:57.913
<i>out for tuitions. Their exams begin next</i>
<i>month. They're very nerous. </i>

140
00:20:58.323 --> 00:20:59.381
<i>And where's our Michael Jackson?</i>

141
00:20:59.725 --> 00:21:01.056
<i>Just back from dance class. </i>

142
00:21:01.260 --> 00:21:03.194
<i>Jameel! It's brother!</i>

143
00:21:04.062 --> 00:21:05.120
<i>We're coming to pick you at the airport. </i>

144
00:21:05.197 --> 00:21:06.664
Get away!

145
00:21:08.000 --> 00:21:09.058
<i>How are you?</i>

146
00:21:09.134 --> 00:21:11.864
<i>Forgot your manners?</i>
<i>How are you?</i>

147
00:21:12.070 --> 00:21:14.732
<i>I'm fine. - Do you ever study</i>
<i>or are you too busy dancing?</i>

148
00:21:14.806 --> 00:21:17.741
<i>I am studying. Did you</i>
<i>get me the new Xbox... </i>

149
00:21:17.809 --> 00:21:18.867
<i>I did. </i>

150
00:21:18.944 --> 00:21:20.070
<i>What time are you arriving day after?</i>

151
00:21:20.145 --> 00:21:23.080
<i>The flight lands at 11.</i>
<i>Be there on time. </i>

152
00:21:23.148 --> 00:21:24.740
<i>of course. </i>

153
00:21:41.767 --> 00:21:42.825
<i>You were thinking?</i>

154
00:21:46.238 --> 00:21:47.296
<i>About my family... </i>

155
00:21:47.706 --> 00:21:51.904
<i>Nothing's going to happen to them. </i>

156
00:21:54.713 --> 00:21:56.112
<i>You will save them from hell... </i>

157
00:21:57.849 --> 00:21:59.441
<i>Just do as I tell you. </i>

158
00:22:01.053 --> 00:22:06.184
<i>If my family or I have harmed</i>
<i>you in any way... I am sorry... </i>

159
00:22:06.658 --> 00:22:07.716
<i>Who's this lovely girl with you... </i>

160
00:22:09.127 --> 00:22:10.185
<i>Girl... </i>

161
00:22:11.930 --> 00:22:12.988
<i>Found it in your suitcase. </i>

162
00:22:13.932 --> 00:22:14.990
<i>Suitcase?</i>

163
00:22:15.067 --> 00:22:16.125
<i>Your luggage!</i>

164
00:22:18.804 --> 00:22:19.862
<i>My luggage is with you?</i>

165
00:22:21.807 --> 00:22:22.865
<i>A friend?</i>

166
00:22:26.945 --> 00:22:28.003
<i>A lover?</i>

167
00:22:29.681 --> 00:22:30.739
<i>Nice. </i>

168
00:22:32.217 --> 00:22:33.741
<i>Is she Muslim?</i>

169
00:22:37.823 --> 00:22:38.881
<i>Christian?</i>

170
00:22:40.959 --> 00:22:42.893
<i>She's Hindu. </i>

171
00:22:44.096 --> 00:22:45.290
<i>Couldn't you find one from our faith... </i>

172
00:22:47.966 --> 00:22:49.365
<i>No. </i>
<i>- Water!</i>

173
00:22:53.972 --> 00:22:55.098
<i>How much do you earn in a month?</i>

174
00:22:57.109 --> 00:22:58.235
<i>How much do you want?</i>

175
00:22:58.310 --> 00:23:01.837
<i>3000 pounds. 250,000 rupees. </i>

176
00:23:02.647 --> 00:23:05.844
<i>You want money? How much?</i>

177
00:23:07.052 --> 00:23:09.179
<i>More than you can earn in your lifetime</i>

178
00:23:11.056 --> 00:23:12.182
<i>What do you want?</i>

179
00:23:14.860 --> 00:23:18.660
<i>Have you ever thought about our people?</i>
<i>Your people?</i>

180
00:23:18.730 --> 00:23:22.723
<i>Your brothers and sisters,</i>
<i>about what the holy book says... </i>

181
00:23:23.068 --> 00:23:24.865
<i>I don't know what you mean. </i>

182
00:23:25.670 --> 00:23:27.069
<i>That's because you haven't thought about it. </i>

183
00:23:27.672 --> 00:23:30.869
<i>Spare a thought. </i>
<i>You'll know what I mean. </i>

184
00:23:38.083 --> 00:23:39.141
<i>A glass of water, please... </i>

185
00:23:46.958 --> 00:23:48.016
<i>Sorry... </i>

186
00:23:57.702 --> 00:23:58.760
<i>Are you hungry?</i>

187
00:23:59.304 --> 00:24:00.293
<i>I'm thirsty. </i>

188
00:24:00.372 --> 00:24:01.634
<i>You must be hungry. </i>

189
00:24:01.706 --> 00:24:02.764
<i>I SAID I AM THIRSTY!</i>

190
00:24:03.241 --> 00:24:04.299
<i>Don't shout!</i>

191
00:24:13.118 --> 00:24:16.713
<i>There's a shop across the road. </i>

192
00:24:18.056 --> 00:24:19.182
<i>You can get dry fruits from there... </i>

193
00:24:23.195 --> 00:24:24.253
<i>You deaf?</i>

194
00:24:41.213 --> 00:24:42.271
<i>Here. </i>

195
00:24:44.950 --> 00:24:46.008
How much?

196
00:24:47.152 --> 00:24:48.210
It's paid for.

197
00:24:50.956 --> 00:24:53.083
<i>Chew some and keep the rest for later... </i>

198
00:24:54.693 --> 00:24:56.217
<i>They fuel the mind and the body. </i>

199
00:25:00.031 --> 00:25:02.625
<i>Mughals used to surive on them... </i>

200
00:25:02.701 --> 00:25:05.169
<i>... every time they went to war. </i>

201
00:25:08.039 --> 00:25:09.233
<i>Don't you know your history?</i>

202
00:25:16.648 --> 00:25:17.706
<i>Not eating any?</i>

203
00:25:31.863 --> 00:25:32.921
<i>Take the next left... </i>

204
00:25:32.998 --> 00:25:35.728
<i>... then the second lane</i>
<i>look for Gulistan building. </i>

205
00:25:36.668 --> 00:25:38.863
<i>There's a common toilet</i>
<i>on the second floor. </i>

206
00:25:39.871 --> 00:25:41.065
<i>There's a number I've left</i>
<i>on a piece of paper... </i>

207
00:25:41.673 --> 00:25:42.731
<i>Why don't you tell me once and for all,</i>
<i>What the fuck you want me to do... </i>

208
00:25:42.807 --> 00:25:44.138
<i>Stop making me run around the damn place... </i>

209
00:25:44.943 --> 00:25:46.001
<i>You tell me and I will do it. </i>

210
00:25:47.946 --> 00:25:49.004
<i>Hello?</i>

211
00:26:08.967 --> 00:26:10.696
Which one is Gulistan?

212
00:26:12.971 --> 00:26:14.029
This one here.

213
00:27:23.908 --> 00:27:25.239
Where's the loo?

214
00:27:25.310 --> 00:27:26.368
Loo?

215
00:27:26.845 --> 00:27:27.903
Toilet!

216
00:27:27.979 --> 00:27:29.037
Can't hold it any longer?

217
00:27:29.114 --> 00:27:30.172
Where's it?

218
00:27:30.248 --> 00:27:31.306
At the back.

219
00:27:54.139 --> 00:27:55.663
<i>Want to come in and wipe my ass... </i>

220
00:29:39.644 --> 00:29:43.045
<i>You saw how our people live... </i>
<i>like scum of this earth... </i>

221
00:29:43.915 --> 00:29:46.975
<i>There's no space to shit. </i>
<i>Where will they live?</i>

222
00:29:49.254 --> 00:29:50.721
<i>I want to speak to my family. </i>

223
00:29:50.989 --> 00:29:52.047
<i>Get out of there. </i>

224
00:29:52.123 --> 00:29:53.647
<i>First let me speak to them. </i>

225
00:29:53.725 --> 00:29:57.661
<i>You want to speak to</i>
<i>them alive then do what say... </i>

226
00:29:57.729 --> 00:29:58.787
<i>I don't like people acting deaf. </i>

227
00:30:06.204 --> 00:30:07.671
<i>Sixty years of our independence... </i>

228
00:30:07.739 --> 00:30:09.866
<i>... economy has progressed,</i>
<i>so much money floating around... </i>

229
00:30:10.275 --> 00:30:13.403
<i>And our people are right</i>
<i>where they used to be. </i>

230
00:30:13.945 --> 00:30:16.209
<i>First we sered the British... </i>
<i>now we sere them. </i>

231
00:30:16.681 --> 00:30:18.080
<i>Before the British we ruled them</i>
<i>- What did you say?</i>

232
00:30:18.149 --> 00:30:19.741
<i>Who's stopping anyone from doing anything?</i>

233
00:30:21.085 --> 00:30:22.143
<i>No one stopped me. </i>

234
00:30:23.221 --> 00:30:25.280
<i>You did it because you</i>
<i>got it all on a bloody platter. </i>

235
00:30:26.090 --> 00:30:28.888
<i>You were very lucky. </i>
<i>What about the rest?</i>

236
00:30:28.960 --> 00:30:33.420
<i>You are wrong. </i>

237
00:30:35.099 --> 00:30:36.964
<i>I did what I did because I wanted to do it... </i>

238
00:30:37.836 --> 00:30:39.701
<i>I went to a government school and college... </i>
<i>like everyone else... </i>

239
00:30:39.771 --> 00:30:41.102
<i>Worked hard. I was in every merit list... </i>

240
00:30:41.773 --> 00:30:42.967
<i>I got a scholarship to study in London. </i>

241
00:30:43.842 --> 00:30:45.309
<i>I slogged my arse off. </i>

242
00:30:46.110 --> 00:30:50.103
<i>I did it because I wanted to. </i>
<i>I wrote my own destiny. </i>

243
00:30:50.248 --> 00:30:51.715
<i>And not just me. Hundreds, thousands. </i>

244
00:30:51.783 --> 00:30:53.307
<i>Every progressive man has done the same... </i>

245
00:30:53.384 --> 00:30:56.251
<i>Every man writes his own destiny. </i>

246
00:30:56.721 --> 00:30:59.121
<i>Whoever says man writes his</i>
<i>own destiny was bullshitting... </i>

247
00:30:59.724 --> 00:31:00.782
<i>Had you gone to our school</i>
<i>instead of the English one... </i>

248
00:31:00.859 --> 00:31:02.258
<i>... you wouldn't be sounding like an idiot... </i>

249
00:31:02.660 --> 00:31:04.719
<i>You might think so. I don't. </i>

250
00:31:04.796 --> 00:31:09.199
<i>Really? So who's writing</i>
<i>your destiny right now?</i>

251
00:31:10.935 --> 00:31:12.061
<i>Now don't stand there like a statue... </i>

252
00:31:15.139 --> 00:31:16.663
<i>Get to the railway crossing. </i>

253
00:31:16.741 --> 00:31:18.072
<i>Climb over. </i>

254
00:31:34.692 --> 00:31:36.421
<i>Shabnam Communication Center. </i>

255
00:31:37.161 --> 00:31:38.219
<i>Can you see it?</i>

256
00:31:45.703 --> 00:31:48.900
<i>Aunt Shabnam will be at the counter. </i>
<i>Show her the number. </i>

257
00:31:49.307 --> 00:31:52.435
<i>Whoever answers the call,</i>
<i>tell him you're calling from Mumbai. </i>

258
00:31:54.112 --> 00:31:56.444
<i>And write down whatever they tell you. </i>

259
00:31:57.849 --> 00:31:58.907
<i>Who will I be calling?</i>

260
00:32:00.718 --> 00:32:01.776
<i>Hello?</i>

261
00:32:13.131 --> 00:32:14.189
Aunt Shabnam?

262
00:32:23.074 --> 00:32:25.065
Son, go watch the shop.

263
00:32:35.086 --> 00:32:37.281
Which city code is this?
- Don't you know?

264
00:32:38.957 --> 00:32:40.015
No.

265
00:32:41.292 --> 00:32:43.886
It's ringing. Talk to Karachi.

266
00:32:53.705 --> 00:32:56.765
Don't look there...

267
00:33:02.046 --> 00:33:05.846
Answer the phone. I'm only human,
not one of your commandos!

268
00:33:08.786 --> 00:33:09.844
<i>Yes. </i>

269
00:33:09.921 --> 00:33:10.979
<i>Where are you calling from?</i>

270
00:33:12.657 --> 00:33:13.715
<i>From Mumbai. </i>

271
00:33:13.791 --> 00:33:14.849
<i>From Mumbai?</i>

272
00:33:16.127 --> 00:33:17.185
<i>okay. </i>

273
00:33:18.062 --> 00:33:21.395
<i>Hello. From Mumbai?</i>
<i>Take the address down. </i>

274
00:33:21.666 --> 00:33:22.724
<i>What?</i>

275
00:33:22.800 --> 00:33:23.858
<i>Write it down. </i>

276
00:33:27.672 --> 00:33:28.730
<i>Write it here... </i>

277
00:33:32.010 --> 00:33:33.068
<i>Indo-Gulf hotel. </i>

278
00:33:35.146 --> 00:33:36.204
<i>Bhindi Bazaar. </i>

279
00:33:37.215 --> 00:33:40.082
<i>Booked under the name Sahil Sheikh. </i>

280
00:33:41.219 --> 00:33:47.749
<i>Room number 203.</i>
<i>Collection number 730730.</i>

281
00:33:48.693 --> 00:33:49.751
<i>God bless. </i>

282
00:33:59.103 --> 00:34:01.697
Keep it safe. You'll need it.

283
00:34:05.643 --> 00:34:06.701
How much?

284
00:34:06.778 --> 00:34:07.836
It's paid for...

285
00:37:28.707 --> 00:37:30.038
Why did I call Karachi?

286
00:37:30.309 --> 00:37:31.367
<i>Get out of there... </i>

287
00:37:31.644 --> 00:37:36.638
<i>What did you make me do?</i>
<i>Why was that cop following me?</i>

288
00:37:38.117 --> 00:37:40.585
<i>I won't tell you again, get in and get out... </i>

289
00:37:44.190 --> 00:37:45.248
<i>Free?</i>

290
00:37:46.659 --> 00:37:47.717
<i>Where to?</i>

291
00:37:47.793 --> 00:37:49.454
<i>Tell him. </i>
<i>- Bhindi Bazaar. </i>

292
00:37:53.532 --> 00:37:58.367
<i>Why was he chasing me?</i>
<i>- you tell me... </i>

293
00:37:59.305 --> 00:38:00.431
<i>What did you do wrong?</i>

294
00:38:03.242 --> 00:38:05.802
<i>You are educated, dress well... not like us. </i>

295
00:38:06.412 --> 00:38:07.470
<i>... belong to a good family... </i>

296
00:38:08.480 --> 00:38:09.538
<i>look good... </i>

297
00:38:12.151 --> 00:38:15.086
<i>What was your mistake?</i>
<i>You called Karachi... </i>

298
00:38:15.154 --> 00:38:19.523
<i>... and he chased you as</i>
<i>if you were a bloody terrorist... </i>

299
00:38:20.092 --> 00:38:22.151
<i>Don't twist this whole thing around!</i>

300
00:38:22.228 --> 00:38:24.389
<i>I'm not. I'm telling you. </i>

301
00:38:24.463 --> 00:38:25.521
<i>You are not telling me... </i>

302
00:38:25.598 --> 00:38:26.656
<i>I asked you a question and... </i>

303
00:38:26.732 --> 00:38:28.222
<i>... you think you got an opportunity to</i>
<i>manipulate and convert me... </i>

304
00:38:33.038 --> 00:38:34.369
<i>I don't think you love your family. </i>

305
00:38:42.114 --> 00:38:44.514
<i>Get to the hotel. </i>
<i>What number did he give you?</i>

306
00:38:45.451 --> 00:38:47.112
<i>You don't know?</i>
<i>- No!</i>

307
00:39:03.202 --> 00:39:04.362
Sings like a dream, doesn't he?

308
00:39:05.137 --> 00:39:06.536
It's all under that cap of his.

309
00:39:07.373 --> 00:39:10.706
Cap sales have gone through
the roof because of him!

310
00:39:15.214 --> 00:39:17.341
What's wrong?
You look tense.

311
00:39:17.549 --> 00:39:19.278
Someone has kidnapped my whole family...

312
00:39:20.686 --> 00:39:23.314
Can you find them... save them... no!
... then just drive...

313
00:39:29.094 --> 00:39:34.293
I'm sorry... I didn't mean it.

314
00:39:35.567 --> 00:39:38.400
That's alright. You were kidding, right?

315
00:39:39.038 --> 00:39:43.202
People talk bad when they are sad...

316
00:39:44.510 --> 00:39:46.102
Just yesterday...

317
00:40:32.558 --> 00:40:34.389
Hey hero!

318
00:40:39.765 --> 00:40:43.132
Need a ride?
For the night?

319
00:40:44.770 --> 00:40:46.362
Expert service giving...

320
00:40:47.339 --> 00:40:50.399
Local, 200.

321
00:40:53.445 --> 00:40:55.140
Foreign...

322
00:40:59.651 --> 00:41:02.449
500. And...

323
00:41:03.722 --> 00:41:07.385
...if there's anything new you want to try...

324
00:41:09.361 --> 00:41:11.420
...it will cost you extra.

325
00:41:16.201 --> 00:41:20.570
So listen, Rani was 20 years old. And Preeti?

326
00:41:20.773 --> 00:41:24.140
Young, innocent.

327
00:41:24.209 --> 00:41:25.267
Fourteen.

328
00:41:25.411 --> 00:41:26.469
Excuse me.

329
00:41:29.114 --> 00:41:32.015
They were both walking down the street...

330
00:41:32.084 --> 00:41:34.746
And... the two loafers were waiting for them.

331
00:41:35.087 --> 00:41:40.525
One of them said "Princess... when can we
have the access to your excess'

332
00:41:41.627 --> 00:41:42.685
And then?

333
00:41:42.761 --> 00:41:49.360
Rani was used to hearing it but poor Preeti...

334
00:41:49.435 --> 00:41:50.493
...She started crying.

335
00:41:51.303 --> 00:41:52.361
Excuse me!

336
00:41:54.106 --> 00:41:55.437
Can't you see we're trying to have a
conversation... go on.

337
00:41:55.607 --> 00:41:57.302
Preeti cried all the way back...

338
00:41:57.576 --> 00:42:01.444
And when they reached home,
Rani asked her...

339
00:42:01.513 --> 00:42:05.108
Those assholes were teasing me...

340
00:42:05.184 --> 00:42:07.482
...why did you start bawling your eyes out...

341
00:42:08.487 --> 00:42:10.352
Preeti cried... and said...

342
00:42:10.522 --> 00:42:18.122
I want to grow breasts like you...

343
00:42:28.173 --> 00:42:29.731
Where is room number 203?

344
00:42:53.532 --> 00:42:54.590
Take him

345
00:42:58.036 --> 00:42:59.094
Go on.

346
00:43:11.617 --> 00:43:13.380
Here's your bed. Sit on it.

347
00:43:15.120 --> 00:43:19.250
Here's some water.
Weren't you thirsty?

348
00:43:25.130 --> 00:43:26.392
What do you people want from me?

349
00:43:33.672 --> 00:43:34.730
Your phone is ringing.

350
00:43:51.123 --> 00:43:53.455
<i>A guy will come to you. </i>
<i>Go with him. </i>

351
00:43:54.192 --> 00:43:58.629
<i>I'm not going anywhere until you tell me</i>
<i>what the fuck you want from me. </i>

352
00:43:59.464 --> 00:44:01.489
<i>He'll ask for the number. </i>
<i>Give it to him. </i>

353
00:44:03.101 --> 00:44:04.159
<i>You remember it, right?</i>

354
00:44:04.236 --> 00:44:07.262
<i>I said I'm not going</i>
<i>anywhere until you tell me... </i>

355
00:44:07.339 --> 00:44:08.397
<i>I'm telling you. </i>

356
00:44:09.174 --> 00:44:11.039
<i>I'm also trying to show</i>
<i>and explain to you... </i>

357
00:44:11.109 --> 00:44:13.634
<i>... but you don't want to see or get it... </i>

358
00:44:15.581 --> 00:44:17.674
<i>Then why... - Your mom is crying for you... </i>

359
00:44:20.485 --> 00:44:21.543
<i>What should I tell her?</i>

360
00:44:23.455 --> 00:44:25.116
<i>She can't wait to see you. </i>

361
00:44:30.395 --> 00:44:31.521
<i>Should I tell her... </i>

362
00:44:35.000 --> 00:44:40.165
<i>You don't give a damn if she lives or dies... </i>

363
00:44:44.409 --> 00:44:45.467
No!

364
00:44:48.447 --> 00:44:51.211
<i>Please, you can't... </i>

365
00:44:51.283 --> 00:44:52.375
<i>Listen to me... </i>

366
00:45:00.158 --> 00:45:01.216
<i>Go... where... he takes you. </i>

367
00:46:29.648 --> 00:46:30.706
Come on!

368
00:46:42.394 --> 00:46:44.362
Are you a cripple or
did you get a paralysis attack.

369
00:46:53.538 --> 00:46:57.235
Never seen a butcher house... follow me...

370
00:46:57.609 --> 00:47:00.009
Feroze, how did you forget your way today?

371
00:47:00.212 --> 00:47:03.238
I didn't... flrst time I found my way... fatass!

372
00:47:05.484 --> 00:47:07.418
And you... you bloody well
memorize it for the way back.

373
00:47:17.095 --> 00:47:18.153
Mr. Khan?

374
00:47:28.140 --> 00:47:29.198
Khan sir

375
00:47:37.315 --> 00:47:40.409
I have got the guy,
he has the number too.

376
00:48:53.291 --> 00:48:55.782
What's in it?

377
00:48:57.596 --> 00:48:58.654
What do you think?

378
00:49:14.079 --> 00:49:15.137
It's a bomb.

379
00:49:27.292 --> 00:49:29.123
Give it to the man
who comes for the suitcase.

380
00:49:33.365 --> 00:49:38.393
Now leave. Wait in your room.
You'll get a call.

381
00:49:45.777 --> 00:49:50.737
What are you staring at? Get going.

382
00:49:51.249 --> 00:49:52.307
You remember the way out, right?

383
00:49:58.056 --> 00:49:59.216
It's fresh meat!

384
00:50:16.241 --> 00:50:22.271
<i>"Shattered at every step... "</i>

385
00:50:23.815 --> 00:50:28.013
<i>"... all through his life... "</i>

386
00:50:37.028 --> 00:50:40.088
<i>"... the man's lost his identity"</i>

387
00:50:44.469 --> 00:50:47.404
<i>"undone by his strife"</i>

388
00:51:22.807 --> 00:51:26.140
<i>"The tick tock scares him. "</i>

389
00:51:30.515 --> 00:51:33.643
<i>"It drags him under"</i>

390
00:52:04.049 --> 00:52:11.455
<i>"These dark winds suffocate"</i>

391
00:52:11.523 --> 00:52:18.725
<i>"They tear him asunder. "</i>

392
00:52:18.797 --> 00:52:27.068
<i>"With him as their target"</i>

393
00:52:42.120 --> 00:52:49.686
<i>"Shattered at every step... "</i>

394
00:52:49.761 --> 00:52:57.691
<i>"... all through his life... "</i>

395
00:53:02.740 --> 00:53:05.675
<i>"... the man's lost his identity. "</i>

396
00:53:07.145 --> 00:53:10.444
<i>Is it too heavy? Should I lighten the load?</i>

397
00:53:10.515 --> 00:53:13.211
<i>"undone by his strife" - o hero!</i>

398
00:53:16.488 --> 00:53:20.584
<i>"... and lost, fading away. "</i>

399
00:56:18.136 --> 00:56:21.401
<i>You thought... </i>

400
00:56:21.472 --> 00:56:22.530
<i>It really was a bomb?</i>

401
00:56:26.110 --> 00:56:27.668
<i>You like to ask questions,</i>
<i>don't you?</i>

402
00:56:28.379 --> 00:56:32.372
<i>Don't you want to know whose</i>
<i>money it is... what it is for?</i>

403
00:56:33.651 --> 00:56:34.709
<i>Want me to shame you... </i>

404
00:56:35.420 --> 00:56:36.478
<i>It's the brotherhood's money. </i>

405
00:56:37.188 --> 00:56:42.057
<i>our brothers sent it from all</i>
<i>over the world for the Holy War. </i>

406
00:56:55.273 --> 00:56:56.467
<i>Have you ever sent anything?</i>

407
00:57:01.546 --> 00:57:02.638
<i>Why are you quiet?</i>

408
00:57:04.749 --> 00:57:08.708
<i>Please, I did what you asked me to. </i>

409
00:57:10.421 --> 00:57:11.479
<i>Now, how long?</i>

410
00:57:13.558 --> 00:57:16.288
<i>I just want to go home. </i>

411
00:57:18.096 --> 00:57:21.554
<i>Just do this last job and then you</i>
<i>and your family can live ever after. </i>

412
00:57:23.434 --> 00:57:25.664
<i>But before that "ever after"</i>
<i>you need to eat... </i>

413
00:57:26.771 --> 00:57:28.204
<i>You must be hungry. </i>

414
00:57:28.506 --> 00:57:29.564
<i>I am not hungry... </i>

415
00:57:31.275 --> 00:57:34.108
<i>After you eat your family eats... </i>

416
00:57:34.379 --> 00:57:35.471
<i>They must be hungry... </i>

417
00:57:40.184 --> 00:57:42.516
<i>There you are. Finish it fast. </i>

418
00:59:09.474 --> 00:59:13.501
<i>Leave all the papers on the table. </i>
<i>Just keep the suitcase note. </i>

419
00:59:14.312 --> 00:59:15.438
<i>And the room keys with you. </i>

420
00:59:24.655 --> 00:59:26.748
<i>Hand over the suitcase</i>
<i>and your job's done. </i>

421
01:00:00.725 --> 01:00:01.783
<i>He's left. </i>

422
01:00:04.562 --> 01:00:07.588
So hero, going without coming...

423
01:00:10.167 --> 01:00:11.225
You'll regret it.

424
01:00:28.286 --> 01:00:29.344
<i>Keep an eye to your right. </i>

425
01:00:30.454 --> 01:00:31.512
<i>The first narrow by-lane. </i>

426
01:00:37.194 --> 01:00:38.252
<i>Take it. </i>

427
01:00:40.565 --> 01:00:42.328
<i>This lane opens out onto the main junction. </i>

428
01:00:42.433 --> 01:00:46.699
<i>Wait at the bus stop over there. </i>
<i>I'll call you again at 4.</i>

429
01:00:49.607 --> 01:00:50.665
<i>And listen. </i>

430
01:00:51.275 --> 01:00:53.402
<i>Don't talk to anyone!</i>

431
01:04:01.766 --> 01:04:03.597
They stole my case!

432
01:05:36.393 --> 01:05:38.054
Sir, that man...

433
01:05:40.297 --> 01:05:44.324
Stop him! He took my suitcase!

434
01:05:46.070 --> 01:05:47.128
Where is the thief?

435
01:06:01.552 --> 01:06:02.610
What's wrong with him?

436
01:06:04.021 --> 01:06:05.113
I think he's going to die.

437
01:06:32.349 --> 01:06:36.149
My suitcase.

438
01:06:44.128 --> 01:06:45.254
He won't spare them.

439
01:06:48.198 --> 01:06:50.063
He will kill my family.

440
01:06:57.408 --> 01:06:59.069
Let my son go!

441
01:07:09.353 --> 01:07:10.411
Let my brother go!

442
01:07:15.025 --> 01:07:16.219
Spare my son!

443
01:07:24.568 --> 01:07:25.626
Jameel!

444
01:08:04.408 --> 01:08:06.569
Rascal!

445
01:08:12.282 --> 01:08:14.716
Fucking day dreaming.

446
01:08:37.307 --> 01:08:40.105
Did you see anyone go by
with a red suitcase?

447
01:08:40.277 --> 01:08:41.369
No, I didn't.

448
01:08:44.648 --> 01:08:47.708
Did you see anyone with a red suitcase?

449
01:08:48.052 --> 01:08:49.110
No.

450
01:08:49.653 --> 01:08:51.484
Did you see someone with a red suitcase?

451
01:08:55.059 --> 01:08:59.462
Did you see anyone
with a red suitcase? - No!

452
01:09:00.130 --> 01:09:02.121
Did you see anyone go by
with a red suitcase? - No!

453
01:09:02.599 --> 01:09:04.191
Did you see anyone pass
by with a red suitcase?

454
01:09:04.401 --> 01:09:05.459
No

455
01:09:31.095 --> 01:09:33.029
Looking for the red suitcase?

456
01:09:40.637 --> 01:09:41.763
It will cost you!

457
01:09:43.107 --> 01:09:44.165
How do you know?

458
01:09:45.442 --> 01:09:47.342
I know this place like the back of my hand.

459
01:09:47.644 --> 01:09:49.669
I know what goes on in
every nook and corner.

460
01:09:51.648 --> 01:09:53.479
Where is it? Please!

461
01:09:54.118 --> 01:10:01.786
I said it will cost you. -Yes

462
01:10:05.462 --> 01:10:07.123
Here, take it all.

463
01:10:08.465 --> 01:10:12.367
But please, my life depends on it.

464
01:10:20.077 --> 01:10:24.070
It's a dangerous place. People don't even
carry their wallets here...

465
01:10:24.748 --> 01:10:27.148
Hero was wondering with
a big suitcase... that too red.

466
01:10:27.751 --> 01:10:29.013
What was in it?

467
01:10:34.091 --> 01:10:35.456
Don't tell me. What do I care?

468
01:10:44.601 --> 01:10:46.296
What was in it?

469
01:10:50.707 --> 01:10:52.538
Don't tell me then. I don't care.

470
01:10:59.049 --> 01:11:00.107
Was it him?

471
01:11:06.056 --> 01:11:07.148
They'll never learn.

472
01:11:08.325 --> 01:11:10.384
They've just been out on bail...

473
01:11:11.328 --> 01:11:12.386
...and they're at it again.

474
01:11:14.731 --> 01:11:16.289
Where are you going?

475
01:11:17.668 --> 01:11:19.295
Do you want him or the suitcase?

476
01:11:24.141 --> 01:11:27.599
They drink together in thatjunkyard

477
01:11:30.614 --> 01:11:31.672
How do you know?

478
01:11:34.151 --> 01:11:36.244
I've done a lot of local
and foreign in there.

479
01:11:44.761 --> 01:11:47.252
How will you go back home
if you give it all to me?

480
01:11:49.099 --> 01:11:50.157
Where do you have to go?

481
01:11:51.602 --> 01:11:52.660
Junction.

482
01:11:57.040 --> 01:11:58.098
Take it...

483
01:12:02.179 --> 01:12:05.171
Your face is so full of dirt. Keep it.

484
01:12:13.056 --> 01:12:14.114
Thank you.

485
01:12:15.058 --> 01:12:16.116
Mention not.

486
01:12:24.334 --> 01:12:28.270
You look like a decent man.
Whatever happened to you?

487
01:12:56.300 --> 01:13:00.361
<i>"Life is fleeting. "</i>

488
01:13:00.437 --> 01:13:04.305
<i>"Some like a bubble. "</i>

489
01:13:04.441 --> 01:13:11.609
<i>"Sometimes high, sometimes low,</i>
<i>fighting the storm. "</i>

490
01:13:11.682 --> 01:13:15.049
<i>"Have mercy, I beg you Lord. "</i>

491
01:13:19.656 --> 01:13:24.218
<i>"... protect me at every step. "</i>

492
01:13:43.480 --> 01:13:51.251
<i>"This delicate, string of breaths... </i>
<i>- Will burn. "</i>

493
01:13:51.421 --> 01:13:58.418
<i>"The life which was presered. </i>
<i>- Will turn. "</i>

494
01:13:58.495 --> 01:14:06.266
<i>"Why be vain when this fair body</i>
<i>will turn to dust someday. "</i>

495
01:14:06.336 --> 01:14:14.107
<i>"No matter how many lamps are lit,</i>
<i>the light will fade away. "</i>

496
01:14:14.177 --> 01:14:17.476
<i>"Have mercy, I beg you, Lord. "</i>

497
01:14:22.219 --> 01:14:25.746
<i>"... protect me at every step. "</i>

498
01:15:05.495 --> 01:15:09.556
<i>"In the glitter of gold or the tinkle of coins... "</i>

499
01:15:09.633 --> 01:15:13.262
<i>"... you can't be found. "</i>

500
01:15:13.503 --> 01:15:20.534
<i>"it's in the grains of dust,</i>
<i>that you're found"</i>

501
01:15:20.610 --> 01:15:28.107
<i>"o Lord, can a human's</i>
<i>wish dare override yours?"</i>

502
01:15:28.251 --> 01:15:30.981
<i>"You are the master puppeteer and every... </i>

503
01:15:31.054 --> 01:15:36.117
<i>... human's fate is at your finger tip"</i>

504
01:15:36.193 --> 01:15:39.390
<i>"Have mercy, I beg you, Lord. "</i>

505
01:15:44.134 --> 01:15:47.661
<i>"... protect me at every step. "</i>

506
01:16:23.240 --> 01:16:24.298
<i>Are you there?</i>

507
01:16:26.443 --> 01:16:29.344
<i>Bus number 84.</i>
<i>It will arrive in 15 minutes. </i>

508
01:16:37.187 --> 01:16:39.985
<i>Whatever you saw today and whatever I</i>

509
01:16:41.992 --> 01:16:43.050
<i>said, did any of it make</i>
<i>any difference to you?</i>

510
01:16:46.596 --> 01:16:50.657
<i>Your name is Aamir, right?</i>
<i>Do you know what it means?</i>

511
01:16:52.068 --> 01:16:53.126
<i>The Leader... </i>

512
01:16:54.271 --> 01:16:59.265
<i>The leader who lives and dies for his</i>
<i>own people... What did you do?</i>

513
01:16:59.543 --> 01:17:03.001
<i>I don't want to be a leader. </i>
<i>I'm just an ordinary man!</i>

514
01:17:03.079 --> 01:17:04.341
<i>It always begins with an ordinary man... </i>

515
01:17:04.414 --> 01:17:05.472
<i>then it slowly becomes a revolution... </i>

516
01:17:06.082 --> 01:17:07.208
<i>I don't want to spark a revolution. </i>

517
01:17:08.585 --> 01:17:10.018
<i>I just want to lead a simple</i>
<i>and peaceful existence... </i>

518
01:17:10.086 --> 01:17:11.144
<i>If everybody thought like you... </i>

519
01:17:11.221 --> 01:17:12.586
<i>... we would still be living in the dark ages... </i>

520
01:17:13.089 --> 01:17:14.522
<i>if everybody minded their own business... </i>

521
01:17:15.492 --> 01:17:16.720
<i>... the world would be a better place... </i>

522
01:17:19.296 --> 01:17:22.094
<i>You talk like a foreigner now. </i>

523
01:17:22.299 --> 01:17:24.767
<i>You forgot your people,</i>
<i>your faith, your war... </i>

524
01:17:25.435 --> 01:17:26.493
<i>I don't want to fight any war... </i>

525
01:17:26.703 --> 01:17:27.761
<i>This is your war too!</i>

526
01:17:28.038 --> 01:17:29.437
<i>No it's not!</i>
<i>- Aren't you a Muslim?</i>

527
01:17:29.639 --> 01:17:32.107
<i>Yes, I am! No, you can't be a Muslim... </i>

528
01:17:34.644 --> 01:17:36.043
<i>Who gives you the right to judge that. </i>

529
01:17:36.112 --> 01:17:38.637
<i>Every Muslim has a moral</i>
<i>duty towards the holy war. </i>

530
01:17:38.715 --> 01:17:40.683
<i>And who decrees that... </i>

531
01:17:41.117 --> 01:17:43.347
<i>You saw for yourself, in that suitcase... </i>

532
01:17:44.187 --> 01:17:47.213
<i>... how our brothers from all over</i>
<i>the world are helping us in this war!</i>

533
01:17:47.457 --> 01:17:48.719
<i>No one is helping anyone... </i>

534
01:17:49.659 --> 01:17:52.321
<i>The only ones who truly</i>
<i>help are your own family... </i>

535
01:17:52.395 --> 01:17:53.453
<i>Do you know more than me?</i>

536
01:17:53.530 --> 01:17:56.363
<i>Well, I know what I need to</i>
<i>know and you know it too... </i>

537
01:17:56.466 --> 01:17:57.592
<i>You won't understand, forget it. </i>

538
01:17:58.668 --> 01:18:00.067
<i>If you don't get it after seeing</i>
<i>what you saw today... </i>

539
01:18:00.136 --> 01:18:01.626
<i>... then you never will... </i>

540
01:18:05.342 --> 01:18:06.639
<i>The bus will be there soon. Get in. </i>

541
01:18:07.677 --> 01:18:11.078
<i>Get off at Andheri station. You'll meet that</i>
<i>psycho driver</i>

542
01:18:11.348 --> 01:18:13.748
<i>Hand over the suitcase and you're free. </i>

543
01:18:16.353 --> 01:18:19.413
<i>And my family?</i>

544
01:18:22.492 --> 01:18:25.086
<i>The job gets done and they go home. </i>

545
01:19:54.584 --> 01:19:57.178
<i>Push the suitcase under</i>
<i>the seat and get off the bus... </i>

546
01:19:59.322 --> 01:20:00.380
<i>What?</i>

547
01:20:01.057 --> 01:20:04.254
<i>Push the suitcase under</i>
<i>the seat and get off the bus!</i>

548
01:20:27.083 --> 01:20:28.710
Are you looking for the red suitcase?

549
01:20:47.303 --> 01:20:50.500
<i>You switched the suitcase!</i>

550
01:20:51.040 --> 01:20:52.507
<i>We have to change the fate of our people. </i>

551
01:20:54.310 --> 01:20:57.040
<i>Now you know the importance</i>
<i>of an ordinary man fighting... </i>

552
01:20:58.615 --> 01:21:01.345
<i>He has to take back what</i>
<i>was taken away from him. </i>

553
01:21:04.521 --> 01:21:08.582
<i>You knew it all along. - I knew everything,</i>
<i>only you did not... </i>

554
01:21:11.060 --> 01:21:14.052
<i>Why me? - Because you did not wait to do it... </i>

555
01:21:14.130 --> 01:21:16.792
<i>... where you should have... </i>
<i>you ran back home... </i>

556
01:21:18.668 --> 01:21:20.693
<i>from London... </i>
<i>if you don't do it now,</i>

557
01:21:20.770 --> 01:21:22.169
<i>you might have to leave Mumbai too... </i>

558
01:21:23.740 --> 01:21:26.607
<i>This is not right. </i>
<i>- This is a retaliatory mission. </i>

559
01:21:28.611 --> 01:21:30.738
<i>Get off. You have three minutes. </i>

560
01:21:32.081 --> 01:21:35.016
<i>And after that you'll be mujahid</i>
<i>and your family will be free... </i>

561
01:21:56.039 --> 01:21:59.065
<i>Get off. You have two and half minutes. </i>

562
01:22:13.456 --> 01:22:14.514
<i>You deaf again?</i>

563
01:22:49.692 --> 01:22:51.159
Now you are a leader!

564
01:25:51.674 --> 01:25:53.642
<i>Congratulations!</i>
<i>He got out of the bus!</i>

565
01:25:55.411 --> 01:25:58.744
<i>Do not disconnect. I want to</i>
<i>hear the sound of Allah's will... </i>

566
01:27:49.458 --> 01:27:50.652
<i>Brother, that idiot!</i>
<i>- What happened?</i>

567
01:28:02.738 --> 01:28:03.796
<i>Brother... </i>

568
01:29:44.106 --> 01:29:46.074
<i>We'd like to tell our viewers</i>
<i>we have breaking news. </i>

569
01:29:46.142 --> 01:29:48.633
<i>There has been a blast in</i>
<i>the Andheri area. </i>

570
01:29:48.711 --> 01:29:50.076
<i>Yes, you've heard it right. </i>

571
01:29:50.179 --> 01:29:53.114
<i>There has been a blast in Andheri. </i>

572
01:30:01.324 --> 01:30:02.689
<i>And one terrorist has been killed in it. </i>

573
01:30:15.671 --> 01:30:17.434
<i>It is not clear... </i>

574
01:30:17.540 --> 01:30:20.304
<i>... why the terrorist ran out</i>
<i>of the bus with the suitcase. </i>

575
01:30:20.376 --> 01:30:23.072
<i>But if the blast had taken place in the bus... </i>

576
01:30:23.145 --> 01:30:24.476
<i>... then at least a hundred</i>
<i>people would've been killed. </i>

577
01:30:24.547 --> 01:30:27.072
<i>The police have refused to</i>
<i>share any information on this... </i>

578
01:30:27.149 --> 01:30:30.084
<i>... Although they claim the suicide bomber... </i>

579
01:30:30.152 --> 01:30:32.017
<i>... might have backed off</i>
<i>in fear in the last moment... </i>

580
01:30:32.621 --> 01:30:39.151
<i>Now we have to see if we can... </i>
<i>- Yes Rahul, can you hear us? Rahul!</i>

581
01:30:39.428 --> 01:30:41.020
Maybe we can't reach him!

582
01:30:41.097 --> 01:30:44.032
We want to inform those
who have just tuned on their TV sets...

583
01:30:44.100 --> 01:30:47.092
...that there has been
a bomb blast in Andheri...
